 takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ig_mdzmKkCwQ7kNvwE_h-1a&_nc_oc=AdqVjaxlqkKstqXko7fwllFjnPIpChCV3YsTswc6THsOMqWatQ_rJLmqDWEvKsjlrHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQfnUw2PUj51C7gt4hlnoo462e9m-7U61Butglssw-KA&oe=6AA41BC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQA7V6dB__MQ7kNvwHhaKh-&_nc_oc=Adoto6UXflk580ujB-qv4BB1aJv4ItN9JbkxGgsk1qRz4Kk6SRbZ29wRcMGP7GKPmOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ1Rkn3yBZzs875VbdmEKVkYOB49m043ZEqwOslGvPmYw&oe=6AA3F0E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pOSKZU3YaL8Q7kNvwFcrjgX&_nc_oc=Adot6a9EJlkLnjYG8iEmtiAam3POTd7cx4KPNRAY9a4527x2t5YG4sZe1IzPEOu7Jb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLuI0KQLJgqkfISkfHDTMddoX7NUUNLGYcFY